[{"text": "Hello, English learners. Welcome back to EnglishPod. My name is Marco.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.08}, {"text": "And I'm Erika.", "start": 5.28, "end": 6.12}, {"text": "And we're bringing you another great elementary lesson for all our elementary learners.", "start": 6.5, "end": 10.88}, {"text": "You know what, Marco? I think this lesson is so useful.", "start": 11.08, "end": 13.66}, {"text": "This is language that you can actually use every single day.", "start": 13.74, "end": 16.740000000000002}, {"text": "Exactly. Every day. Exactly. Because today we're going to be teaching you small talk.", "start": 17.02, "end": 21.36}, {"text": "So, what is small talk?", "start": 21.580000000000002, "end": 23.740000000000002}, {"text": "Well, small talk is small conversations that you would have with people that you don't know very well,", "start": 24.080000000000002, "end": 28.62}, {"text": "but you still want to be polite.", "start": 28.62, "end": 30.52}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 30.84, "end": 31.04}, {"text": "Right? And you want to maybe just chat a little bit.", "start": 31.26, "end": 33.84}, {"text": "Okay, so let's listen to our dialogue.", "start": 33.94, "end": 35.56}, {"text": "And as always, it's going to be a little bit fast, but don't worry about it.", "start": 35.78, "end": 39.02}, {"text": "Because we'll come back in a minute and help you with some of the difficult language.", "start": 39.04, "end": 42.400000000000006}, {"text": "Morning.", "start": 51.46, "end": 51.900000000000006}, {"text": "Hi there, Mr. Anderson. How are you on this fine morning?", "start": 52.540000000000006, "end": 55.620000000000005}, {"text": "Fine. Thank you.", "start": 56.02, "end": 57.2}, {"text": "It sure is cold this morning, isn't it? I barely even got out of bed.", "start": 57.2, "end": 61.32}, {"text": "Yeah. It's pretty cold, alright.", "start": 61.84, "end": 63.6}, {"text": "Did you catch the news this morning? I heard that there was a fire in Byron Street.", "start": 64.06, "end": 68.22}, {"text": "No. I didn't hear about that.", "start": 68.82000000000001, "end": 70.66}, {"text": "Did you happen to watch the football game last night? The Patriots scored in the last minute.", "start": 70.88, "end": 75.06}, {"text": "No. I don't like football.", "start": 75.64, "end": 77.4}, {"text": "Oh, by the way, I saw you with your daughter at the office Christmas party. She's really beautiful.", "start": 78.06, "end": 83.04}, {"text": "She's my wife. Oh, here's my floor. Nice talking to you. Goodbye.", "start": 83.04, "end": 87.54}, {"text": "Oh, sir. This is the 56th floor. We're on the 70th.", "start": 88.10000000000001, "end": 91.18}, {"text": "That's okay. I'll take the stairs.", "start": 91.38000000000001, "end": 93.44000000000001}, {"text": "Okay. I think this guy was a little bit annoying.", "start": 93.44, "end": 100.74}, {"text": "Yeah. Mr. Anderson really didn't want to talk to him, did he?", "start": 101.25999999999999, "end": 104.42}, {"text": "Yeah. I think that was pretty obvious. He left the elevator in a hurry.", "start": 104.52, "end": 107.5}, {"text": "Okay. Let's take a look at our language today in Language Takeaway.", "start": 107.78, "end": 110.58}, {"text": "Language Takeaway.", "start": 112.08, "end": 113.16}, {"text": "Alright. What do we have today in Language Takeaway?", "start": 113.16, "end": 116.1}, {"text": "Well, we've got four words and phrases and our first one is barely even.", "start": 116.25999999999999, "end": 120.6}, {"text": "Barely even.", "start": 121.11999999999999, "end": 122.14}, {"text": "Barely even.", "start": 122.32, "end": 123.0}, {"text": "So, how do we use barely even? It's a little bit difficult.", "start": 123.25999999999999, "end": 125.96}, {"text": "It's really similar to like almost couldn't or almost nothing or almost can't.", "start": 126.1, "end": 131.14}, {"text": "So, we use it usually in a negative sense.", "start": 131.2, "end": 133.56}, {"text": "For example, I could say, I was so busy today, I could barely even eat my lunch.", "start": 133.85999999999999, "end": 139.2}, {"text": "Okay. So, I can maybe say, it was so dark, I could barely even see.", "start": 139.2, "end": 144.95999999999998}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 145.42, "end": 145.72}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 145.94, "end": 146.28}, {"text": "Yeah. Or, I'm so poor, I can barely even pay my rent.", "start": 146.38, "end": 150.98}, {"text": "Okay. Good. Barely even.", "start": 151.1, "end": 153.32}, {"text": "Mm-hmm.", "start": 153.5, "end": 153.73999999999998}, {"text": "Alright. Let's take a look at our next one.", "start": 154.0, "end": 155.62}, {"text": "Catch.", "start": 156.33999999999997, "end": 156.72}, {"text": "Catch.", "start": 157.5, "end": 157.98}, {"text": "Catch.", "start": 158.38, "end": 158.83999999999997}, {"text": "Did you catch the news?", "start": 159.06, "end": 160.35999999999999}, {"text": "So, by did you catch the news, you mean did you hear the news?", "start": 160.82, "end": 164.06}, {"text": "Exactly. So, how else can we use this? Did you catch?", "start": 164.17999999999998, "end": 167.16}, {"text": "A really common one is, I didn't catch your name.", "start": 167.16, "end": 170.5}, {"text": "Yeah. I didn't hear your name.", "start": 170.68, "end": 171.92}, {"text": "I didn't hear your name.", "start": 171.94, "end": 172.94}, {"text": "Yeah. And we can also say, I didn't catch what he said.", "start": 173.18, "end": 176.04}, {"text": "I didn't catch what he said. Yeah.", "start": 176.2, "end": 177.51999999999998}, {"text": "So, I didn't hear.", "start": 177.66, "end": 179.01999999999998}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 179.16, "end": 179.32}, {"text": "Okay. Let's look at our next word.", "start": 179.51999999999998, "end": 181.3}, {"text": "By the way.", "start": 181.57999999999998, "end": 182.18}, {"text": "By the way.", "start": 182.54, "end": 183.34}, {"text": "By the way.", "start": 183.64, "end": 184.64}, {"text": "By the way.", "start": 184.8, "end": 185.46}, {"text": "Okay. So, let's listen to some examples first of how we can use by the way.", "start": 185.8, "end": 190.54}, {"text": "And then we'll come back and talk more about it.", "start": 190.9, "end": 192.74}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 193.54, "end": 194.3}, {"text": "Are you going to be at the meeting today?", "start": 194.3, "end": 198.22}, {"text": "Yeah. I'll be there.", "start": 198.56, "end": 199.38000000000002}, {"text": "Oh. By the way.", "start": 199.74, "end": 200.54000000000002}, {"text": "Did you hear what happened today?", "start": 200.66000000000003, "end": 201.88000000000002}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 205.52, "end": 206.28}, {"text": "By the way.", "start": 209.70000000000002, "end": 210.88000000000002}, {"text": "I almost forgot to tell you.", "start": 211.04000000000002, "end": 213.10000000000002}, {"text": "Maggie called.", "start": 213.46, "end": 214.0}, {"text": "Okay. So, I see that when we say, by the way, we're introducing a point after we've already talked about something.", "start": 214.0, "end": 224.88}, {"text": "Exactly. And maybe it's not even related to the topic we were talking about.", "start": 225.18, "end": 228.74}, {"text": "No, it's a different topic.", "start": 228.82, "end": 229.9}, {"text": "Different topic, right?", "start": 230.02, "end": 230.92000000000002}, {"text": "It's like saying, oh, I almost forgot to tell you.", "start": 230.96, "end": 233.32}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 233.5, "end": 233.9}, {"text": "So, it's like, oh, Erica, don't forget we have a meeting today.", "start": 234.16, "end": 237.08}, {"text": "Oh, and by the way, I like your new haircut.", "start": 237.18, "end": 239.34}, {"text": "Thanks, Marco.", "start": 239.78, "end": 240.28}, {"text": "All right. See? That's the way you would use by the way.", "start": 240.28, "end": 243.24}, {"text": "Okay. And our last word on language takeaway.", "start": 243.62, "end": 245.38}, {"text": "Take the stairs.", "start": 246.16, "end": 246.92000000000002}, {"text": "Take the stairs.", "start": 247.24, "end": 248.1}, {"text": "Take the stairs.", "start": 248.4, "end": 249.5}, {"text": "Take the stairs.", "start": 249.68, "end": 250.28}, {"text": "So, it doesn't mean you're going to take them somewhere.", "start": 250.54, "end": 252.24}, {"text": "No, no, you're not taking them home with you.", "start": 252.36, "end": 254.34}, {"text": "It means you're going to go up the stairs.", "start": 254.86, "end": 256.6}, {"text": "Okay. So, take the stairs.", "start": 257.74, "end": 259.16}, {"text": "Yes. A lot of people might say use the stairs or go up the stairs.", "start": 259.36, "end": 263.84}, {"text": "But our English pod learners, they know, right?", "start": 263.84, "end": 266.42}, {"text": "To use take the stairs.", "start": 266.54, "end": 268.18}, {"text": "Yep.", "start": 268.3, "end": 268.52}, {"text": "Take the stairs.", "start": 268.52, "end": 269.34}, {"text": "Okay. So, now we're ready to listen to our dialogue again.", "start": 269.84, "end": 272.47999999999996}, {"text": "We're going to slow it down a little bit.", "start": 272.62, "end": 274.24}, {"text": "And this will help you to catch these phrases a little bit better.", "start": 274.34, "end": 277.08}, {"text": "Morning.", "start": 288.08, "end": 288.56}, {"text": "Hi there, Mr. Anderson.", "start": 289.5, "end": 291.02}, {"text": "How are you on this fine morning?", "start": 291.4, "end": 293.35999999999996}, {"text": "Fine. Thank you.", "start": 294.21999999999997, "end": 295.91999999999996}, {"text": "It sure is cold this morning, isn't it?", "start": 295.92, "end": 298.76}, {"text": "I barely even got out of bed.", "start": 299.04, "end": 300.72}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 301.34000000000003, "end": 301.74}, {"text": "It's pretty cold, all right.", "start": 302.28000000000003, "end": 304.46000000000004}, {"text": "Did you catch the news this morning?", "start": 304.78000000000003, "end": 306.76}, {"text": "I heard that there was a fire in Byron Street.", "start": 307.08000000000004, "end": 309.70000000000005}, {"text": "No.", "start": 310.24, "end": 310.78000000000003}, {"text": "I didn't hear about that.", "start": 311.34000000000003, "end": 313.12}, {"text": "Did you happen to watch the football game last night?", "start": 313.36, "end": 315.88}, {"text": "The Patriots scored in the last minute.", "start": 316.02000000000004, "end": 318.1}, {"text": "No.", "start": 318.64, "end": 319.1}, {"text": "I don't like football.", "start": 319.1, "end": 321.02000000000004}, {"text": "Oh, by the way, I saw you with your daughter at the office Christmas party.", "start": 321.02000000000004, "end": 326.20000000000005}, {"text": "She's really beautiful.", "start": 326.46000000000004, "end": 328.02000000000004}, {"text": "She's my wife.", "start": 328.56, "end": 329.86}, {"text": "Oh, here's my floor.", "start": 330.3, "end": 331.78000000000003}, {"text": "Nice talking to you.", "start": 332.18, "end": 333.38}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 333.70000000000005, "end": 334.20000000000005}, {"text": "Oh, sir.", "start": 334.88, "end": 335.48}, {"text": "This is the 56th floor.", "start": 335.62, "end": 337.04}, {"text": "We're on the 70th.", "start": 337.26000000000005, "end": 338.54}, {"text": "That's okay.", "start": 338.54, "end": 339.54}, {"text": "I'll take the stairs.", "start": 339.78000000000003, "end": 341.14000000000004}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 344.36, "end": 344.96000000000004}, {"text": "So now let's take a look at ways to start up some small talk in putting it together.", "start": 345.22, "end": 350.78000000000003}, {"text": "Putting it together.", "start": 352.46000000000004, "end": 353.66}, {"text": "So, Marco, today we've got some great patterns or structures that you can use in your small talk.", "start": 353.66, "end": 361.42}, {"text": "Yeah, exactly.", "start": 361.56, "end": 362.28000000000003}, {"text": "We saw some great patterns.", "start": 362.38000000000005, "end": 363.6}, {"text": "Let's start with the first one.", "start": 363.72, "end": 364.90000000000003}, {"text": "It sure is cold this morning.", "start": 365.20000000000005, "end": 366.82000000000005}, {"text": "It sure is cold.", "start": 367.02000000000004, "end": 368.82000000000005}, {"text": "It sure is cold.", "start": 369.12, "end": 370.66}, {"text": "It sure is cold.", "start": 370.78000000000003, "end": 372.08000000000004}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 372.46000000000004, "end": 372.76000000000005}, {"text": "So we can change it up a little bit and say, it sure is hot.", "start": 372.76000000000005, "end": 376.8}, {"text": "Or it sure is late.", "start": 377.28000000000003, "end": 378.76000000000005}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 379.5, "end": 379.86}, {"text": "This sure is interesting.", "start": 380.20000000000005, "end": 381.74}, {"text": "Or you could say, he sure is smart.", "start": 381.74, "end": 384.44}, {"text": "So basically, you can change the adjective.", "start": 384.68, "end": 387.66}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 387.92, "end": 388.12}, {"text": "Cold, hot, smart, hard, difficult.", "start": 388.22, "end": 390.04}, {"text": "And when you say, sure is, this is a great way of emphasizing that you believe this adjective to be true.", "start": 390.38, "end": 397.14}, {"text": "Okay.", "start": 397.28000000000003, "end": 397.68}, {"text": "It sure is.", "start": 397.94, "end": 398.5}, {"text": "Now, what would be the answer to this?", "start": 398.6, "end": 400.1}, {"text": "Well, in the dialogue, Mr. Anderson said, yeah, it's pretty cold, all right.", "start": 400.3, "end": 405.42}, {"text": "It's pretty cold, all right.", "start": 405.88, "end": 407.7}, {"text": "It's pretty cold, all right.", "start": 407.78000000000003, "end": 409.08}, {"text": "Right.", "start": 409.08, "end": 409.12}, {"text": "So again, using the examples we used before, we can say, oh, it's pretty hot, all right.", "start": 409.65999999999997, "end": 414.7}, {"text": "Or it's pretty late, all right.", "start": 415.14, "end": 416.94}, {"text": "Or he's pretty smart, all right.", "start": 417.18, "end": 419.09999999999997}, {"text": "Or this is pretty interesting, all right.", "start": 419.52, "end": 421.32}, {"text": "So it means you're agreeing with that person.", "start": 421.64, "end": 423.3}, {"text": "Exactly.", "start": 423.44, "end": 423.78}, {"text": "Okay, great.", "start": 423.97999999999996, "end": 424.78}, {"text": "So Marco, these things, it sure is blank.", "start": 424.78, "end": 427.29999999999995}, {"text": "And yeah, it's blank, all right.", "start": 427.5, "end": 430.15999999999997}, {"text": "These can go together really well, can't they?", "start": 430.26, "end": 432.38}, {"text": "Yeah, as a question and answer format.", "start": 432.67999999999995, "end": 434.55999999999995}, {"text": "They go well.", "start": 434.67999999999995, "end": 435.41999999999996}, {"text": "So why don't we listen to some examples of how these two phrases work together.", "start": 435.64, "end": 439.53999999999996}, {"text": "Example one.", "start": 440.35999999999996, "end": 441.15999999999997}, {"text": "Example two.", "start": 441.16, "end": 450.38000000000005}, {"text": "", "start": 450.38000000000005, "end": 450.38000000000005}, {"text": "The bus is sure late today.", "start": 452.74, "end": 454.88000000000005}, {"text": "Yeah, it's late, all right.", "start": 455.26000000000005, "end": 456.48}, {"text": "Example three.", "start": 460.28000000000003, "end": 461.16}, {"text": "This class is really hard.", "start": 463.24, "end": 465.52000000000004}, {"text": "Yeah, it's hard, all right.", "start": 465.52, "end": 467.59999999999997}, {"text": "Okay, so now let's take a look at our next word and putting it together.", "start": 469.94, "end": 472.85999999999996}, {"text": "Did you happen to?", "start": 473.68, "end": 474.79999999999995}, {"text": "Did you happen to?", "start": 475.03999999999996, "end": 476.12}, {"text": "Did you happen to?", "start": 476.46, "end": 477.7}, {"text": "Did you happen to?", "start": 477.82, "end": 478.78}, {"text": "Did you happen to see Bob this morning?", "start": 478.97999999999996, "end": 481.06}, {"text": "I didn't happen to see Bob.", "start": 481.5, "end": 483.18}, {"text": "So it means like...", "start": 483.79999999999995, "end": 485.14}, {"text": "Like, did you by chance?", "start": 485.14, "end": 486.68}, {"text": "By chance.", "start": 486.78, "end": 487.34}, {"text": "Did you by chance see Bob or something?", "start": 487.4, "end": 489.46}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 489.71999999999997, "end": 489.85999999999996}, {"text": "Okay, another example would be, did you happen to go to that restaurant I recommended?", "start": 489.86, "end": 494.76}, {"text": "Or maybe, do you happen to have a pen?", "start": 495.52000000000004, "end": 498.26}, {"text": "Do you happen to know where the bathroom is?", "start": 498.6, "end": 500.98}, {"text": "Yeah, that's a really useful one.", "start": 501.3, "end": 502.76}, {"text": "That's a useful one.", "start": 502.84000000000003, "end": 503.66}, {"text": "That's basically how you would use this structure.", "start": 503.78000000000003, "end": 505.86}, {"text": "Did you happen to?", "start": 506.22, "end": 507.32}, {"text": "Do you happen to?", "start": 507.48, "end": 508.44}, {"text": "So now let's listen to our dialogue for the third time.", "start": 508.58000000000004, "end": 511.54}, {"text": "And I'm sure that you'll be able to understand everything.", "start": 511.84000000000003, "end": 514.66}, {"text": "Morning.", "start": 519.86, "end": 525.52}, {"text": "Hi there, Mr. Anderson.", "start": 526.3000000000001, "end": 527.42}, {"text": "How are you on this fine morning?", "start": 527.8000000000001, "end": 529.26}, {"text": "Fine.", "start": 529.6, "end": 530.04}, {"text": "Thank you.", "start": 530.34, "end": 530.86}, {"text": "It sure is cold this morning, isn't it?", "start": 531.28, "end": 533.1800000000001}, {"text": "I barely even got out of bed.", "start": 533.3000000000001, "end": 534.94}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 535.38, "end": 535.6800000000001}, {"text": "It's pretty cold, alright.", "start": 536.0, "end": 537.2}, {"text": "Did you catch the news this morning?", "start": 537.66, "end": 539.1800000000001}, {"text": "I heard that there was a fire in Byron Street.", "start": 539.44, "end": 541.86}, {"text": "No.", "start": 542.46, "end": 542.84}, {"text": "I didn't hear about that.", "start": 543.1, "end": 544.26}, {"text": "Did you happen to watch the football game last night?", "start": 544.26, "end": 546.66}, {"text": "The Patriots scored in the last minute.", "start": 546.94, "end": 548.78}, {"text": "No.", "start": 549.34, "end": 549.64}, {"text": "I don't like football.", "start": 549.86, "end": 551.04}, {"text": "Oh, by the way, I saw you with your daughter at the office Christmas party.", "start": 551.7, "end": 555.36}, {"text": "She's really beautiful.", "start": 555.6800000000001, "end": 556.7}, {"text": "She's my wife.", "start": 557.04, "end": 557.82}, {"text": "Oh, here's my floor.", "start": 558.22, "end": 559.42}, {"text": "Nice talking to you.", "start": 559.6800000000001, "end": 560.62}, {"text": "Goodbye.", "start": 560.76, "end": 561.14}, {"text": "Oh, sir, this is the 56th floor.", "start": 561.74, "end": 563.5}, {"text": "We're on the 70th.", "start": 563.76, "end": 564.82}, {"text": "That's okay.", "start": 565.02, "end": 565.7}, {"text": "I'll take the stairs.", "start": 565.82, "end": 567.0}, {"text": "All right, Marco.", "start": 572.32, "end": 573.1800000000001}, {"text": "That was a really useful dialogue for daily life, wasn't it?", "start": 573.1800000000001, "end": 575.8000000000001}, {"text": "Yeah, I think you can find a lot of useful language there and that you can apply.", "start": 576.08, "end": 579.76}, {"text": "Tomorrow.", "start": 580.18, "end": 580.5}, {"text": "Yeah.", "start": 580.9, "end": 581.12}, {"text": "Well, speaking of useful things, let's talk a little bit about our website.", "start": 581.5, "end": 584.56}, {"text": "Yeah, be sure to go to our website at englishpod.com where you can find other lessons as well.", "start": 584.98, "end": 589.66}, {"text": "Maybe you're an intermediate student or advanced.", "start": 589.86, "end": 592.22}, {"text": "Yes.", "start": 592.4, "end": 592.68}, {"text": "So, we've got intermediate, advanced, upper intermediate lessons on our website.", "start": 592.76, "end": 596.28}, {"text": "And a lot of other resources that you can explore.", "start": 596.28, "end": 598.64}, {"text": "So, be sure to come to our website and leave all your comments because Erica and I are always there and we're really happy to answer all of your questions.", "start": 598.8199999999999, "end": 604.8199999999999}, {"text": "Okay, everyone.", "start": 605.02, "end": 605.62}, {"text": "Well, we're out of time.", "start": 605.74, "end": 607.0}, {"text": "But until next time, goodbye.", "start": 607.14, "end": 609.4}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 609.4, "end": 609.6}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 610.14, "end": 610.4599999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 610.5, "end": 610.8199999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 610.88, "end": 611.26}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 611.36, "end": 611.62}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 611.72, "end": 611.98}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 612.26, "end": 612.38}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 612.52, "end": 612.76}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 612.84, "end": 613.24}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 613.34, "end": 613.68}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 613.76, "end": 613.9399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 614.04, "end": 614.28}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 614.42, "end": 614.72}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 614.8199999999999, "end": 615.06}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 615.22, "end": 615.52}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 615.6, "end": 615.92}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 616.02, "end": 616.4399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 616.56, "end": 616.9399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 617.0799999999999, "end": 617.3199999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 617.42, "end": 617.54}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 617.66, "end": 617.68}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 617.76, "end": 617.8}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 617.9399999999999, "end": 618.0}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 618.12, "end": 618.16}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 618.3199999999999, "end": 618.42}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 618.54, "end": 618.62}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 618.74, "end": 618.9}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 619.06, "end": 619.22}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 619.3, "end": 619.4399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 619.52, "end": 619.62}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 619.74, "end": 619.84}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 619.9399999999999, "end": 620.24}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 620.34, "end": 620.68}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 620.78, "end": 621.16}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 621.3, "end": 621.5}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 621.6, "end": 621.66}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 621.74, "end": 621.78}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 621.88, "end": 621.98}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 622.16, "end": 622.38}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 622.5, "end": 622.6}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 622.72, "end": 623.0}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 623.16, "end": 623.26}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 623.38, "end": 623.42}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 623.5799999999999, "end": 623.52}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 623.66, "end": 623.68}, {"text": "", "start": 623.78, "end": 623.78}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 623.9, "end": 624.0}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 624.16, "end": 624.4399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 624.5799999999999, "end": 625.1}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 625.26, "end": 625.4399999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 625.5799999999999, "end": 625.6}, {"text": "", "start": 625.72, "end": 625.72}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 625.8199999999999, "end": 625.9599999999999}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 626.12, "end": 626.4}, {"text": "Bye.", "start": 626.54, "end": 627.0799999999999}]